ve for12 years and I only got to descend into it now :)Have you got any caves in the deeper part of your country ?I gotta go now ...CUBgs**bgs**To: aususRe:   HiDate: Jan 19 Hi !OK I learnt geography as well :) And I know why Netherland is called as it is.That's why I said 'deeper' in the country. Who knows ? You don't need hugecliff to have caves ... Did you know that the lowest icecave in the world is in hungary. It's about 200 meters above see level ...How went your exam ? I'm anxious to know :)Keep up the good work.ByeBgs**bgs**To: aususSubj: hpDate: Jan 28  Hi !Tanx for the URL. I akready got a lot of info from it. They didn't answer to all of my questions but i'm sure with time i'll manage everything. (For example i dunno whether it is possible to hirebikes suitable for longer distances like 200km. I'd like to go around the country and i'd need  tomake these  distances.)Btw: I forgot the name of the town you live in *blush*. Could you tell me ?CUBgs**"
